WEBVTT

00:27.630 --> 00:29.460
<b>There's still more of them...</b>

00:29.830 --> 00:33.500
<b>We finally made it all this way, but still...</b>

00:35.210 --> 00:38.960
<b>At this rate everyone is going 
to get pulled into the void.</b>

00:39.750 --> 00:40.960
<b>Sis...</b>

00:41.500 --> 00:43.920
<b>You and I are the only ones left.</b>

00:45.580 --> 00:46.420
<b>But...</b>

00:47.580 --> 00:50.040
<b>we cannot let ourselves succumb to this!</b>

00:50.040 --> 00:54.080
<b>We're the very last hope this planet has!</b>

00:55.170 --> 00:56.960
<b>Sis, you're right.</b>

01:05.710 --> 01:06.880
<b>There are only two left!</b>

01:10.630 --> 01:12.630
<b>Careful! We've got something inbound!</b>

01:15.790 --> 01:17.080
<b>What the?!</b>

01:19.040 --> 01:20.040
<b>No!</b>

01:20.380 --> 01:21.830
<b>Sis!</b>

01:27.630 --> 01:28.790
<b>Sis?</b>

01:28.790 --> 01:30.330
<b>What a relief...</b>

01:32.290 --> 01:33.420
<b>Where are we?</b>

01:33.420 --> 01:37.460
<b>This must be somewhere between the worlds
connected to the Holy Tree.</b>

01:37.460 --> 01:39.790
<b>But we can't remain here long.</b>

01:45.130 --> 01:48.210
<b>Huh? Someone is calling to me...</b>

01:57.130 --> 01:58.830
<b>Sis, what are you doing?</b>

01:59.250 --> 02:02.420
<b>I want you to take the very last of my power.</b>

02:02.420 --> 02:03.750
<b>No! Stop!</b>

02:03.750 --> 02:06.630
<b>I wanted to save everyone...</b>

02:07.210 --> 02:08.670
<b>Keep everyone happy...</b>

02:10.670 --> 02:12.080
<b>Keep you happy...</b>

02:12.080 --> 02:14.630
<b>No! No, please, stop!</b>

02:16.040 --> 02:17.880
<b>Be a ray of hope...</b>

02:18.670 --> 02:20.830
<b>March on towards the future.</b>

02:20.830 --> 02:23.580
<b>And find friends who will 
walk the path with you...</b>

02:25.500 --> 02:28.170
<b>Sis!</b>

02:32.330 --> 02:34.040
<b>What's that light?</b>

02:44.420 --> 02:47.040
<b>You've been through many 
hardships, haven't you?</b>

02:49.830 --> 02:51.080
<b>Who are you?!</b>

02:51.880 --> 02:53.170
<b>Where am I?</b>

02:53.710 --> 02:55.830
<b>I'm Botan Kamine.</b>

02:55.830 --> 02:58.290
<b>This is the Shinjugamine Girl's School.</b>

02:59.210 --> 03:01.790
<b>Shinjugamine Girl's School...?</b>

03:02.330 --> 03:03.830
<b>That's impossible!</b>

03:04.130 --> 03:09.080
<b>It would seem there is 
much I must ask you about.</b>

03:09.750 --> 03:11.920
<b>Would you tell me your name?</b>

03:14.750 --> 03:16.170
<b>I'm...</b>

03:18.790 --> 03:24.830
<b>Now among the stars that stretch as far as the eye can see,
find the constellation of your dreams</b>

03:24.830 --> 03:33.250
<b>Bring your hearts together 
and someday it will come true</b>

03:41.540 --> 03:46.500
<b>Are you ready to run for it?</b>

03:46.960 --> 03:52.080
<b>The road is long, but you've 
got your friends with you</b>

03:52.500 --> 03:56.790
<b>Instead of just making faces and worrying</b>

03:56.790 --> 04:01.710
<b>Just go in head-first with a smile</b>

04:02.290 --> 04:07.750
<b>As hearts cross even in mere passing</b>

04:07.750 --> 04:10.460
<b>They will grow into deeper bonds</b>

04:10.460 --> 04:17.580
<b>Bring them together as one and find 
the power to take on the future</b>

04:18.250 --> 04:24.080
<b>Now look up to the stars as far as the eye can see
and keep chasing that dream</b>

04:24.080 --> 04:29.500
<b>That outreached hand will 
encourage you not to give up</b>

04:29.500 --> 04:35.040
<b>No matter how many hundreds of 
tries it takes, you're not alone</b>

04:35.040 --> 04:42.040
<b>You can do it, look up, 
there's surely a starry sky</b>

04:42.040 --> 04:44.880
<b>Your dreams will come true</b>

04:47.080 --> 04:52.040
<b>Episode 11
Truth</b>

04:58.210 --> 05:00.580
<b>I'm not from this world.</b>

05:00.960 --> 05:03.170
<b>I'm a Hoshimori member 
from another dimension.</b>

05:03.920 --> 05:05.670
<b>I should apologize.</b>

05:05.670 --> 05:09.670
<b>It was just such an unprecedented situation
that I could not find the words to explain.</b>

05:10.710 --> 05:13.210
<b>So she's from another dimension...?</b>

05:13.210 --> 05:15.830
<b>That's a bit much to take 
in all of a sudden...</b>

05:15.830 --> 05:17.920
<b>I don't really get it.</b>

05:19.250 --> 05:22.330
<b>Yes, but she was chosen by the Holy Tree.</b>

05:29.380 --> 05:30.210
<b>Take this!</b>

05:33.920 --> 05:37.960
<b>She didn't simply seem to know
how to fight them, she truly did.</b>

05:38.250 --> 05:41.330
<b>Does this mean she's from 
like a parallel world?</b>

05:41.330 --> 05:43.040
<b>What's that?</b>

05:43.210 --> 05:45.710
<b>Some call them parallel dimensions.</b>

05:46.580 --> 05:51.920
<b>For example, let's say Miki is walking around,
and she comes to a fork in the road.</b>

05:51.920 --> 05:52.750
<b>Okay.</b>

05:53.880 --> 05:56.920
<b>Then let's say she goes to the left,</b>

05:57.420 --> 06:01.040
<b>and she meets up with Subaru and Haruka
and they have a good time.</b>

06:03.540 --> 06:06.670
<b>Now, what would have happened
if she had gone right instead?</b>

06:06.670 --> 06:07.460
<b>Huh?</b>

06:09.460 --> 06:13.750
<b>She would then run into Itsuki and
get pulled away for some afterschool training.</b>

06:15.630 --> 06:16.920
<b>Aww man...</b>

06:16.920 --> 06:18.580
<b>This is merely an example.</b>

06:20.630 --> 06:25.000
<b>What I mean is, the world itself is split
by these options and decisions.</b>

06:25.710 --> 06:28.130
<b>Of course, we can't know what happens
in these other alternate worlds.</b>

06:28.420 --> 06:31.830
<b>If I could run into Kaede, I'd go right!</b>

06:31.830 --> 06:33.420
<b>Oh Mimi.</b>

06:33.420 --> 06:36.750
<b>So it's just like different story branches
in video games, then.</b>

06:36.750 --> 06:38.420
<b>Games, huh...</b>

06:38.420 --> 06:42.580
<b>I'm not sure if I understand more
or maybe even less now...</b>

06:44.250 --> 06:47.750
<b>Back in my world, we didn't 
have a "Judgment Day".</b>

06:47.750 --> 06:48.790
<b>What?!</b>

06:49.000 --> 06:52.630
<b>Truth is, we did face an Irous invasion.</b>

06:52.630 --> 06:57.880
<b>But the members of Hoshimori
successfully fought them back.</b>

06:58.130 --> 07:03.130
<b>So as you can see, Misaki's world
and ours are quite different.</b>

07:03.540 --> 07:07.500
<b>Our two worlds may have branched off
from one another long ago.</b>

07:08.670 --> 07:11.580
<b>So that Miki we saw back there...</b>

07:11.580 --> 07:15.330
<b>Was she a version of Miki from another world?</b>

07:20.210 --> 07:24.920
<b>My sister put all her faith in me
and sent me to this world...</b>

07:25.540 --> 07:29.790
<b>So that explains your behavior 
when we all first met.</b>

07:29.790 --> 07:30.750
<b>Yeah...</b>

07:30.750 --> 07:33.130
<b>Okay, I think I kind of get it now.</b>

07:33.130 --> 07:36.960
<b>But I still don't really understand
these parallel worlds or whatever.</b>

07:37.250 --> 07:41.380
<b>But we've already seen this new enemy,
and we have Misaki right here in front of us.</b>

07:41.380 --> 07:46.460
<b>Indeed, instead of worrying about
what we should or should not believe,</b>

07:46.460 --> 07:50.710
<b>what we should be concerned about
is how to deal with the threat at hand.</b>

07:50.880 --> 07:52.290
<b>The threat, huh...</b>

07:52.290 --> 07:55.130
<b>I don't really get it, 
but I'll do what I can!</b>

07:55.460 --> 07:57.710
<b>This will certainly be tough.</b>

07:58.750 --> 08:02.000
<b>Misaki, can we run through 
everything one last time?</b>

08:02.960 --> 08:05.750
<b>You're not from this world, but from another.</b>

08:05.750 --> 08:06.670
<b>Yes.</b>

08:06.670 --> 08:09.210
<b>Your world lost the power of the Holy Tree,</b>

08:09.210 --> 08:11.580
<b>Hoshimori lost their powers,</b>

08:11.580 --> 08:13.460
<b>and the world came to an end.</b>

08:14.330 --> 08:15.540
<b>That is correct.</b>

08:16.170 --> 08:17.630
<b>Misaki...</b>

08:17.630 --> 08:22.210
<b>And I believe what is powering my sister
and the others here in this world now is...</b>

08:23.290 --> 08:27.960
<b>the Holy Tree from my world
that lost its light and fell into darkness,</b>

08:29.250 --> 08:30.330
<b>the Wicked Tree.</b>

08:31.670 --> 08:36.210
<b>Ms. President, could this Wicked Tree
have made it to our world?</b>

08:37.790 --> 08:40.130
<b>It would seem most probable.</b>

08:41.170 --> 08:43.630
<b>Urara, are you following all this?</b>

08:45.540 --> 08:47.790
<b>I don't get it...</b>

08:48.040 --> 08:52.830
<b>What happened is some bad people came from
some other place so we need to fight them.</b>

08:52.830 --> 08:55.670
<b>Yeah, if we all work together...</b>

08:55.670 --> 08:56.750
<b>But...</b>

08:57.630 --> 09:01.460
<b>We'll be fighting against 
Misaki's sister, won't we?</b>

09:01.630 --> 09:05.170
<b>Yeah, and the Hoshimori 
team from her world...</b>

09:05.670 --> 09:08.880
<b>Do you think we can beat them?</b>

09:09.460 --> 09:12.170
<b>Do you think it's even okay to...?</b>

09:12.380 --> 09:13.830
<b>Sadone...</b>

09:21.880 --> 09:23.920
<b>Let's leave it at that for now.</b>

09:25.040 --> 09:29.080
<b>Us teachers will come up with a plan
about how we should handle this.</b>

09:29.080 --> 09:32.210
<b>You girls should stay on 
alert back at the dorms.</b>

09:32.210 --> 09:33.290
<b>Got it?</b>

09:33.290 --> 09:34.130
<b>Got it...</b>

09:59.500 --> 10:03.250
<b>Oh, I truly have gotten my 
hands on the greatest of toys.</b>

10:06.960 --> 10:09.710
<b>I had almost forgotten the fragrance here.</b>

10:13.170 --> 10:15.040
<b>Who goes there?</b>

10:15.040 --> 10:17.960
<b>Who would dare summon me again?</b>

10:23.040 --> 10:24.130
<b>Oh, my...</b>

10:33.380 --> 10:40.540
<b>Would you imagine that, a long since forgotten toy
is back to grant me chaos.</b>

10:41.210 --> 10:45.330
<b>The Hoshimori of one world 
will now fight another.</b>

10:46.130 --> 10:48.460
<b>One Hoshimori team that 
has fallen to darkness.</b>

10:48.460 --> 10:52.000
<b>And one that yet believes in the light....</b>

10:52.580 --> 10:55.580
<b>What a marvelous game!</b>

10:56.750 --> 11:02.040
<b>Now, my Hoshimori girls,
preparations are almost in order.</b>

11:02.330 --> 11:07.080
<b>Grant me, oh grant me the enjoyment I crave.</b>

11:09.000 --> 11:12.960
