11:20.210 --> 11:21.420
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

11:21.790 --> 11:23.790
<b>For keeping this a secret all this time.</b>

11:24.790 --> 11:28.380
<b>No, you don't even have to worry about it.</b>

11:28.380 --> 11:33.290
<b>I don't think I would have known
what to do if I was you, either.</b>

11:33.580 --> 11:37.630
<b>Still, I lied to everyone, it's true.</b>

11:37.790 --> 11:40.080
<b>No way, you didn't!</b>

11:42.170 --> 11:43.580
<b>Hey, Misaki.</b>

11:44.040 --> 11:48.750
<b>Instead of keeping it all pent up,
you could talk it out with me, you know.</b>

11:49.630 --> 11:52.460
<b>I know I might not be 
the biggest help, but...</b>

11:57.580 --> 11:59.500
<b>Yeah, thanks.</b>

12:00.500 --> 12:01.460
<b>But...</b>

12:02.080 --> 12:04.920
<b>right now, I just want to be alone.</b>

12:06.080 --> 12:08.000
<b>Misaki...</b>

12:09.080 --> 12:12.000
<b>Everyone seemed really 
taken aback by it all, hmm?</b>

12:12.000 --> 12:16.460
<b>Yeah. And I imagine it had quite a
harsh impact on Misaki herself.</b>

12:17.460 --> 12:19.880
<b>We've got to do something for her.</b>

12:21.080 --> 12:21.960
<b>Ms. President,</b>

12:21.960 --> 12:24.540
<b>you said the Holy Tree brought her here?</b>

12:24.540 --> 12:26.750
<b>I am quite sure that is the case.</b>

12:26.920 --> 12:29.290
<b>She has said nearly as much herself,</b>

12:29.290 --> 12:32.790
<b>and she quite literally appeared
right before the Tree itself.</b>

12:34.080 --> 12:37.460
<b>Do you think after she came here to our world</b>

12:37.460 --> 12:41.080
<b>that this Wicked Tree used the same tunnel
to follow her here?</b>

12:41.880 --> 12:43.380
<b>Not at all.</b>

12:43.380 --> 12:44.710
<b>How do you know?</b>

12:45.880 --> 12:53.210
<b>If that were the case, the Holy Tree surely would not
have let that evil power through with her.</b>

12:53.210 --> 12:55.920
<b>But then why is it here now?</b>

12:55.920 --> 13:01.210
<b>If there are infinite parallel worlds,
why did it come here?</b>

13:01.210 --> 13:05.000
<b>It's a bit too much to right 
off as simple coincidence.</b>

13:06.710 --> 13:12.250
<b>Our Holy Tree answered the prayers
of Misaki and her sister.</b>

13:12.710 --> 13:15.920
<b>And if that's true, we must imagine that
the opposite could also be true.</b>

13:16.130 --> 13:17.130
<b>The opposite?</b>

13:17.130 --> 13:22.540
<b>The Wicked Tree may also be answering
the evil desires of someone from our world.</b>

13:38.290 --> 13:40.630
<b>I'm Misaki. Salutations.</b>

13:40.830 --> 13:43.080
<b>Thanks for saving Sadone!</b>

13:43.080 --> 13:45.040
<b>I merely took down the Irous.</b>

13:49.210 --> 13:50.210
<b>Glad you're all right.</b>

13:50.210 --> 13:51.000
<b>Huh?</b>

13:51.330 --> 13:53.290
<b>That was a good hit.</b>

14:03.830 --> 14:05.710
<b>You! You're not the real Kurumi!</b>

14:06.460 --> 14:08.130
<b>Now then, you!</b>

14:08.880 --> 14:10.170
<b>It's time to die!</b>

14:12.790 --> 14:14.080
<b>Misaki?!</b>

14:14.210 --> 14:16.630
<b>Ready? We only have one shot!</b>

14:16.790 --> 14:18.540
<b>Okay, do it!</b>

14:18.670 --> 14:19.750
<b>Here goes!</b>

14:30.460 --> 14:32.210
<b>What is it? What's-</b>

14:32.210 --> 14:33.210
<b>...wrong?</b>

14:33.210 --> 14:36.880
<b>Why...? How could this happen?</b>

14:40.880 --> 14:42.250
<b>That's really good!</b>

14:42.250 --> 14:44.170
<b>Okay then, have some of mine!</b>

14:46.210 --> 14:48.460
<b>You dare to run amok in our village?</b>

14:48.460 --> 14:50.750
<b>You insolent beast!</b>

14:50.750 --> 14:52.710
<b>Your deeds cannot go unpunished!</b>

14:53.540 --> 14:54.960
<b>It's so good!</b>

14:54.960 --> 14:58.130
<b>Mom's sweet curry is THE best!</b>

15:02.040 --> 15:02.750
<b>It's great.</b>

15:02.750 --> 15:06.500
<b>Oh, I'm so happy! Feel free 
to have seconds, okay?</b>

15:06.750 --> 15:10.790
<b>Oh, yes. The food at school is good,</b>

15:10.790 --> 15:14.210
<b>but this has that real 
home-style goodness to it.</b>

15:14.500 --> 15:16.790
<b>It's like food for the soul.</b>

15:32.960 --> 15:36.460
<b>Oh, Miku? Sorry I couldn't answer your calls.</b>

15:36.750 --> 15:39.630
<b>Jeez, I was so worried about you!</b>

15:39.630 --> 15:41.540
<b>You just took off all of a sudden...</b>

15:41.540 --> 15:42.830
<b>Sorry, sorry!</b>

15:42.830 --> 15:46.210
<b>So, are you and Misaki okay?</b>

15:46.210 --> 15:49.380
<b>Yeah. We're okay, I guess.</b>

15:50.710 --> 15:52.880
<b>What's that supposed to mean?</b>

15:52.880 --> 15:55.290
<b>I mean, I guess that's good, but...</b>

15:55.630 --> 15:59.830
<b>Anyway! We've still got lots of
Mom's special curry leftover,</b>

15:59.830 --> 16:01.580
<b>so hurry on home, okay?</b>

16:01.580 --> 16:04.920
<b>Okay! Thanks Miku. Buh-bye.</b>

16:09.500 --> 16:10.960
<b>Misaki!</b>

16:14.540 --> 16:20.290
