I woke up in this world.</b>

16:21.040 --> 16:22.330
<b>Misaki!
It was my own fault that I lost you,
and I couldn't forgive myself for it.</b>

16:22.330 --> 16:22.540
<b>It was my own fault that I lost you,
and I couldn't forgive myself for it.</b>

16:22.540 --> 16:23.880
<b>Misaki!
It was my own fault that I lost you,
and I couldn't forgive myself for it.</b>

16:23.880 --> 16:26.290
<b>It was my own fault that I lost you,
and I couldn't forgive myself for it.</b>

16:27.130 --> 16:29.630
<b>I didn't want to lose anyone else.</b>

16:29.790 --> 16:31.790
<b>I didn't want to depend on anyone.</b>

16:31.790 --> 16:32.500
<b>Misaki! Can you hear us?</b>

16:32.500 --> 16:34.080
<b>Misaki! Can you hear us?
I just wanted to get stronger all on my own.</b>

16:34.080 --> 16:35.170
<b>Misaki!
I just wanted to get stronger all on my own.</b>

16:36.170 --> 16:37.540
<b>But you know what?</b>

16:37.540 --> 16:40.130
<b>Despite all that, I found people who taught me
