16:41.500 --> 16:43.040
<b>Misaki!
Despite all that, I found people who taught me
the importance of working together.</b>

16:43.920 --> 16:45.790
<b>Through them even I found something
I now want to fight to protect.</b>

16:45.790 --> 16:47.170
<b>Misaki!
Through them even I found something
I now want to fight to protect.</b>

16:47.170 --> 16:47.420
<b>Through them even I found something
I now want to fight to protect.</b>

16:47.420 --> 16:48.710
<b>Misaki!
Through them even I found something
I now want to fight to protect.</b>

16:48.710 --> 16:49.250
<b>Through them even I found something
I now want to fight to protect.</b>

16:52.920 --> 16:55.420
<b>That's why, Sis...</b>

16:56.460 --> 17:03.790
<b>if it's because of me, because of us,
that the people here are now in danger...</b>

17:06.290 --> 17:08.290
<b>Then I will be the one 
that puts a stop to you!</b>

17:08.290 --> 17:11.080
<b>No matter what becomes of me for it!</b>

17:13.420 --> 17:15.080
<b>What? Those hooded girls again?!</b>

17:15.080 --> 17:17.000
<b>The very same. I need you to hurry.</b>

17:17.000 --> 17:19.170
<b>Misaki is fighting them all alone!</b>

17:37.130 --> 17:40.330
<b>Now where did all that vigor disappear to?</b>

17:40.880 --> 17:48.330
<b>Still, I'd hate to end this lovely
sisterly performance quite so soon...</b>

17:58.670 --> 18:03.670
<b>Now then, let the life escape out of you
at the hands of your very own sister.</b>

18:06.750 --> 18:08.000
<b>Sis...</b>

18:08.750 --> 18:12.040
<b>It's my fault this happened to you...</b>

18:14.080 --> 18:17.080
<b>It must have been so hard for you.</b>

18:19.130 --> 18:19.920
<b>Hmm?</b>

18:20.130 --> 18:25.170
<b>This might not get me anywhere.</b>

18:25.750 --> 18:27.630
<b>But it doesn't matter anymore...</b>

18:33.790 --> 18:38.830
<b>I'm sorry. I couldn't be that ray of hope.</b>

18:40.250 --> 18:44.040
<b>But at least this time I'll go with you...</b>

18:48.000 --> 18:50.080
<b>I'm sorry, everyone.</b>

18:53.420 --> 18:54.500
<b>No!</b>

18:58.420 --> 19:00.330
<b>Are you okay, Misaki?</b>

19:00.880 --> 19:01.960
<b>Why...?</b>

19:01.960 --> 19:05.000
<b>You idiot! It's because we're friends!</b>

19:06.830 --> 19:12.670
<b>Ever since you joined us, we've gotten through
all the tough stuff together, haven't we?</b>

19:13.170 --> 19:15.170
<b>This is no different than that.</b>

19:15.460 --> 19:16.420
<b>Miki...</b>

19:16.790 --> 19:19.880
<b>So, let's do this together!</b>

19:19.880 --> 19:21.580
<b>Let's get your sister back!</b>

19:26.210 --> 19:27.210
<b>Misaki!</b>

19:27.540 --> 19:31.960
<b>I don't think we've paid you back
for saving us back at our concert!</b>

19:31.960 --> 19:35.080
<b>We're truly thankful for that.</b>

19:36.210 --> 19:39.580
<b>I still didn't thank you for helping me
with that big spider either!</b>

19:39.580 --> 19:43.040
<b>One cannot repay kindness
with negligence now can they?</b>

19:43.040 --> 19:47.460
<b>Now listen here, Misaki!
How many times have I said not to go off alone?</b>

19:47.460 --> 19:50.880
<b>Just when we thought you'd changed
here you are again!</b>

19:50.880 --> 19:53.880
<b>Misaki, you saved me before.</b>

19:54.170 --> 19:56.420
<b>Now it's my turn to save you!</b>

19:56.420 --> 19:57.380
<b>Indeed!</b>

19:57.500 --> 19:58.790
<b>Girls...</b>

20:00.540 --> 20:03.460
<b>Sounds like everyone's on the same page.</b>

20:04.080 --> 20:05.670
<b>It seems so!</b>

20:05.670 --> 20:09.170
<b>Yup! Misaki, have some faith in us!</b>

20:09.500 --> 20:12.920
<b>If we all work together
there's nothing that can stop us!</b>

20:17.380 --> 20:18.710
<b>Thank you...</b>

20:20.290 --> 20:23.880
<b>Yes, what charming friendship indeed...</b>

20:24.170 --> 20:30.290
<b>Tell me, will you still feel 
the same after seeing this?</b>

20:34.420 --> 20:35.670
<b>What the?!</b>

20:52.750 --> 20:53.750
<b>Abnormality detected</b>

20:54.540 --> 20:57.630
<b>We're getting abnormalities
on all of our Holy Tree readings!</b>

20:57.630 --> 20:59.790
<b>The miasma is getting denser and denser too.</b>

21:00.170 --> 21:02.040
<b>This is bad! At this rate...</b>

21:03.460 --> 21:06.000
<b>Girls! What on Earth is going on over there?!</b>

21:06.630 --> 21:09.170
<b>There's this big turtle...</b>

21:10.960 --> 21:14.290
<b>There! The Wicked Tree is in there!</b>

21:14.460 --> 21:15.580
<b>What?!</b>

21:16.000 --> 21:17.880
<b>Let's go, Asuha!</b>

21:17.880 --> 21:20.420
<b>Right! Misaki, your celestial suit!</b>

21:20.420 --> 21:21.380
<b>Roger!</b>

21:44.630 --> 21:46.420
<b>Let's do this, Misaki!</b>

21:47.170 --> 21:48.000
<b>Yeah!</b>

21:50.330 --> 21:52.420
<b>Hoshimori Class, move out!</b>

21:52.670 --> 21:53.710
<b>Roger!</b>

22:12.460 --> 22:18.920
<b>Things should be moving, 
but they feel stopped</b>

22:18.920 --> 22:25.250
<b>I contemplate alone, pretending to understand</b>

22:25.250 --> 22:31.670
<b>But with the end of each 
twinkle reason draws away</b>

22:31.670 --> 22:37.460
<b>Reflected in my pupils as running noise</b>

22:37.460 --> 22:44.000
<b>Consciousness trapped 
away in a lonely rondeau</b>

22:44.250 --> 22:47.670
<b>When it's held up, make your escape</b>

22:47.670 --> 22:53.040
<b>And let us perform together</b>

22:53.170 --> 23:00.000
<b>There's no one to decide but you yourself</b>

23:00.000 --> 23:06.170
<b>Whether right or wrong, it 
will all start to seem fine</b>

23:06.170 --> 23:12.960
<b>One over the other, if you believe 
it will come true someday</b>

23:12.960 --> 23:21.790
<b>The blank music score will be 
filled with a one of a kind</b>

23:22.040 --> 23:25.040
<b>Ring out melody</b>

23:27.040 --> 23:28.960
<b>What's with this terrible miasma?</b>

23:28.960 --> 23:32.130
<b>Those black hoods, they're 
stronger than we thought!</b>

23:32.130 --> 23:35.130
<b>Misaki, we've got to make 
it to that Wicked Tree!</b>

23:35.460 --> 23:37.040
<b>Next time: "Bonds"!</b>

23:36.000 --> 23:41.000
<b>Next Episode
Bonds
Leave it to me! Woof!</b>

23:37.040 --> 23:38.920
<b>We'll show you the bonds 
that tie Hoshimori together!</b>

23:38.920 --> 23:40.130
<b>You just watch!</b>
